Check a fixture tree against its inline `siloscan-expect:` markers

Usage: ss test [OPTIONS] <FIXTURE_DIR>

Arguments:
  <FIXTURE_DIR>  Fixture directory

Options:
      --rules <DIR>       Rule directories
      --no-default-rules  Do not load the built-in rule pack (a run that ends up with no rules at all checks nothing and is refused with exit 2)
  -h, --help              Print help
